- Fewer than three qualifying orders: 0%.

Use actual database records. Do not hardcode customer-specific discounts.

Use this view in the customer's profile and checkout. The backend must verify the discount and eligibility before placing the order.

Ensure customers with no qualifying orders are handled correctly.

